Subject: [PATCH 009/138] dt-bindings: clock: apple,nco: Add t7000 compatible

The A7/A8 (t7000) NCO block has the same per-channel register layout
as the t8103 one, but its channels are spaced 0x1000 apart instead of
0x4000, so it cannot use the generic apple,nco fallback.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/clock/apple,nco.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/clock/apple,nco.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/clock/apple,nco.yaml
index 080454f56..dd3f48065 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/clock/apple,nco.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/clock/apple,nco.yaml
@@ -20,6 +20,7 @@ description: |
 properties:
   compatible:
     oneOf:
+      - const: apple,t7000-nco
       - items:
           - const: apple,t6020-nco
           - const: apple,t8103-nco
